{
 "fps": 30,
 "duration": 54.47,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "H1",
   "text": "Dans ma ville, il n'y a qu'une seule r\u00e8gle.",
   "start": 0.9,
   "end": 3.143,
   "s0": 1030,
   "s1": 50499
  },
  {
   "id": "H2",
   "text": "\u00c0 minuit, on ferme les volets. Et on ne regarde jamais dehors.",
   "start": 3.743,
   "end": 7.906,
   "s0": 295,
   "s1": 92077
  },
  {
   "id": "H3",
   "text": "Ce soir, maman a oubli\u00e9 celui de ma chambre.",
   "start": 8.706,
   "end": 11.511,
   "s0": 3423,
   "s1": 65268
  },
  {
   "id": "H4",
   "text": "Alors, j'ai regard\u00e9.",
   "start": 12.211,
   "end": 13.692,
   "s0": 3181,
   "s1": 35836
  },
  {
   "id": "H5",
   "text": "La rue \u00e9tait pleine de gens.",
   "start": 14.692,
   "end": 16.201,
   "s0": 989,
   "s1": 34263
  },
  {
   "id": "H6",
   "text": "Immobiles. Bien espac\u00e9s. Ils fixaient notre maison.",
   "start": 16.801,
   "end": 20.663,
   "s0": 880,
   "s1": 86036
  },
  {
   "id": "H7",
   "text": "Puis les lampadaires se sont \u00e9teints. Un par un.",
   "start": 21.663,
   "end": 24.653,
   "s0": 2620,
   "s1": 68555
  },
  {
   "id": "H8",
   "text": "Et au bout de la rue, quelque chose de tr\u00e8s grand s'est mis \u00e0 marcher vers nous.",
   "start": 25.453,
   "end": 28.702,
   "s0": 856,
   "s1": 72506
  },
  {
   "id": "H9",
   "text": "D'un coup, ils ont tous tourn\u00e9 la t\u00eate vers ma fen\u00eatre.",
   "start": 29.702,
   "end": 32.654,
   "s0": 2301,
   "s1": 67391
  },
  {
   "id": "H10",
   "text": "On a frapp\u00e9 \u00e0 la porte. Trois coups.",
   "start": 33.854,
   "end": 36.041,
   "s0": 3646,
   "s1": 51872
  },
  {
   "id": "H11",
   "text": "Puis la voix de maman, dehors, a dit mon pr\u00e9nom.",
   "start": 36.941,
   "end": 40.317,
   "s0": 2181,
   "s1": 76610
  },
  {
   "id": "M1",
   "text": "Jade ? Ouvre-moi, ma ch\u00e9rie.",
   "start": 40.917,
   "end": 43.455,
   "s0": 341,
   "s1": 56302
  },
  {
   "id": "H12",
   "text": "Sauf que maman \u00e9tait juste \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de moi.",
   "start": 44.855,
   "end": 46.894,
   "s0": 3424,
   "s1": 48393
  },
  {
   "id": "H13",
   "text": "Tu ouvres ? Ou tu te caches ? Dis-le en commentaire.",
   "start": 47.894,
   "end": 51.272,
   "s0": 0,
   "s1": 74482
  }
 ],
